  "description": "Harvey Price is a real person, a young Black boy who has been featured in public media and social media memes. His appearance in the meme is used to illustrate physical growth over time, but the framing can be seen as infantilizing or objectifying, reducing his identity to a visual comparison of growth. This requires background knowledge about his public visibility and the cultural context of such comparisons.",
